TITLE Equilibrate Ca solution with calcite, gypsum, aragonite and gas phase using fixed fugacity
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
    CO2(g) -0.0 10
    CH4(g) 0.69897 10
    H2S(g) 1.0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -alkalinity true
END
